WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.690
At the Easter Vigil, churches
light a great candle:

2
00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.360
the Paschal candle.

3
00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:10.410
For Christians, Easter is not
one day but a season of 50 days.

4
00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.480
The candle burns at
services all through it.

5
00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:17.590
Yet in some churches, on a
Thursday 40 days after Easter,

6
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.370
the candle is put out after the Gospel.

7
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.020
Why put out the great Easter candle,
ten days before the season ends?

8
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:29.560
In this mission, you'll read how wind and
fire marked the day that many call the

9
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.380
birthday of the Church.

10
00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.900
Then you'll see how
festivals are changing,

11
00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.550
and why Christians disagree about it.

12
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:42.110
Your mission: find out why some churches
put out the Easter candle after 40 days.
